      "teks": "Innal-lażīna āmanū wal-lażīna hādū wan-naṣārā waṣ-ṣābi'īna man āmana billāhi wal- yaumil-ākhiri wa ‘amila ṣāliḥan fa lahum ajruhum ‘inda rabbihim, wa lā khaufun ‘alaihim wa lā hum yaḥzanūn(a).",
      "keterangan": "حذف الهمزة",
