      "teks": "Wa min ḥaiṡu kharajta fawalli wajhaka syaṭral-masjidil-ḥarām(i), wa innahū lal-ḥaqqu mir rabbik(a), wa mallāhu bigāfilin ‘ammā ta‘malūn(a).",
