      "teks": "Wa min ḥaiṡu kharajta fa walli wajhaka syaṭral-masjidil-ḥarām(i), wa ḥaiṡumā kuntum fawallū wujūhakum syaṭrah(ū), li'allā yakūna lin-nāsi ‘alaikum ḥujjatun illal-lażīna ẓalamū minhum, falā takhsyauhum wakhsyaunī, wa li'utimma ni‘matī ‘alaikum wa la‘allakum tahtadūn(a).",
