      "teks": "Kutiba ‘alaikum iżā ḥaḍara aḥadakumul-mautu in taraka kahirā(n), al-waṣiyyatu lil-wālidaini wal-aqrabīna bil-ma‘rūf(i), ḥaqqan ‘alal-muttaqīn(a).",
