      "teks": "Yā ayyuhal-lażīna āmanū anfiqū min ṭayyibāti mā kasabtum wa mimmā akhrajnā lakum minal-arḍ(i), wa lā tayammamul-khabīṡa minhu tunfiqūna wa lastum bi'ākhiżīhi illā an tugmiḍū fīh(i), wa‘lamū annallāha ganiyyun ḥamīd(un).",
