      "teks": "In tubduṣ-ṣadaqāti fani‘immā hiy(a), wa in tukhfūhā wa tu'tūhal-fuqarā'a fahuwa khairul lakum, wa yukaffiru ‘ankum min sayyi'ātikum, wallāhu bimā ta‘malūna khabīr(un).",
