      "teks": "Allażīna yunfiqūna amwālahum bil-laili wan-nahāri sirraw wa ‘alāniyatan falahum ajruhum ‘inda rabbihim, wa lā khaufun ‘alaihim wa lā hum yaḥzanūn(a).",
