      "teks": "Qul yā ‘ibādiyal-lażīna asrafū ‘alā anfusihim lā taqnaṭū mir raḥmatillāh(i), innallāha yagfiruż-żunūba jamī‘ā(n), innahū huwal-gafūrur-raḥīm(u).",
